{"chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1","number":31,"title":"Adversativangaben & Gegensätze ausdrücken","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Der Radweg ist teuer allerdings sinnvoll","speaker":"Meike","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Wenngleich es teuer ist lohnt sich das Projekt","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Demgegenüber stehen die Kosten für Parkplätze","speaker":"Meike","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Nichtsdestotrotz sollten wir den Radweg bauen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Einerseits verstehe ich das andererseits bin ich besorgt wegen des Budgets","speaker":"Meike","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Gut dann suchen wir einen Kompromiss","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"allerdings","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adverb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c1-31-adversativangaben-und-gegensaetze-ausdruecken","level":"C1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"allerdings","voiceR